{{see|bill|Bill}}

==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{Dan.|is}} ''[[bil]]'', a shortened form of ''[[automobil]]'', ultimately from {{Gr.|is}} ''[[αὐτός]]'' (''autós'') ‘self’, stem αὐτo- (''auto-'') + {{L.|is}} ''[[mobilis]]'' ‘mobile’, ergo ‘[vehicle] which moves by itself’.

===Noun===
'''bíll''' {{m}} ([[bíls|bíl-s]], [[bílar|bíl-ar]])

# [[car]] ([[motorcar]], [[automobile]])

